## Quick Tips for a New Year’s Stay

| Tip | Why it matters |
|-----|----------------|
| **Book early** | Rates rise as the date approaches, especially for 5‑star properties. |
| **Check cancellation policy** | Some hotels offer free cancellation up to 48 hrs before arrival. |
| **Ask for a room with a view** | Central Park or city skyline views add a special touch. |
| **Use the “Pay‑later” option** | Keeps your credit card balance low until the last 7 days. |
| **Confirm parking or valet** | Central Park area can be pricey for parking. |

